    "enUS": {
      "description": "Thanks to you and Omarion (May he rest in peace), I am now able to create Polar bracers. All you need to do is bring me the materials and pay a small crafting fee.",
      "dialogue": {
        "504352a4c5a563e3bc48": "Here is your order, $N. Delivered as promised!",
        "7f040d3cae8e6f84ed04": "Thanks to you and Omarion (May he rest in peace), I am now able to create Polar bracers. All you need to do is bring me the materials and pay a small crafting fee.",
        "cec7cf2847bcd9706edb": "Have you brought the materials?"
      },
      "summary": "Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 4 Frozen Runes, 12 Enchanted Leather, 3 Essence of Water, 3 Cured Rugged Hides and 200 gold. \n",
      "title": "Polar Bracers",
